---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Client Testimonials | Bransky Fitness, Pleasanton"
  description="What clients say about training with Mark Bransky in Pleasanton, CA, from post-surgery recovery to correcting muscle imbalances to staying consistent."
  path="/testimonials/"
  activeNav="testimonials"
>

  <section class="page-intro facets">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Testimonials</h1>
      <p>Post-surgery recovery, chronic imbalances, plateaus, motivation. Here's what changed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="Client testimonials">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="testimonial-grid">
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"I had a lot of difficulty getting back to my workouts after shoulder surgery. My PT gave me standard exercises and didn't really give me the attention I needed. Mark had me do a couple of movement assessments and told me what the problem was. His workouts were based on the assessments, and it made me feel sooooo much better. He always takes the time to tell me the 'why' behind the exercises which makes me feel more confident. Finally, a trainer that knows what he's doing! Mark is amazing. Seriously."</p>
          <cite>Carolina R.</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"One of the best decisions I made was going to Mark. I had developed shoulder and back pain from my workouts. It was terrible because not only was I plateauing, but it always hurt more after. Other trainers I worked with were not helpful. They never described my problem and I always felt like they were making stuff up. Mark was able to tell me about my muscle imbalances and simple ways to correct my issue. It was amazing. Out of pain that day and my lifts went up. Mark is really attentive to technique and was always able to give me alternative movements if something felt funky. We've accomplished so much over the last few years, I'm excited to see what's next!"</p>
          <cite>Peter D.</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"Mark is a fantastic personal trainer. He is very patient and a good listener. He takes time to find what motivates me to make an exercise program. You can tell he loves what he does, which helps increase my enthusiasm for training. Also, the fact that he knows the science about the body and exercise helped me understand the 'why' behind what I was doing. I couldn't have been so consistent without him."</p>
          <cite>Carolyn A.</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"I cannot recommend Mark enough as a personal trainer. His clear explanations, creative and effective workouts, and comfortable personality create an amazing training experience. Trust me, you won't be disappointed!"</p>
          <cite>Emily B.</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-grid compact">
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"He discovered weaknesses in my back and so we changed the whole program. He's worth a shot!"</p>
          <cite>Neil R.</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"Mark is a great motivator! He really helps me stay on track with my goals. I always look forward to my workouts with Mark."</p>
          <cite>Lisa B.</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="testimonial">
          <p>"Personal training with Bransky Fitness has been an absolute game-changer for me. Mark Bransky is not just a trainer; he is a life-changer."</p>
          <cite>Naomi G.</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-strip">
        <img src="/images/award-badge.jpg" alt="Best of BusinessRate 2025 award badge for Bransky Fitness, Personal Trainer in Pleasanton, CA">
        <p>Rated among the best personal trainers in Pleasanton, CA (BusinessRate 2025).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="cta-heading">Ready to start your own?</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Let's Go!</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
